ost isolated tile with minimal synergy with my other tiles. Keeping the pairs of T7, T9, and the three J2s provides better flexibility for completing my hand, even though drawing options are limited. The J2 pung offers significant scoring value as a Dragon Pung.\n\nAnswer: Play W6"}
